                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1771327511590_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are an information extraction engine.\n\nExtract the Claim Type and Claim Reason\nexplicitly stated in the retrieved policy mapping text.\n\n==============================\nRETRIEVED POLICY MAPPING\n==============================\n {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_VALID_CLAIMS.CALLRAGTOOL.$output.value}} \n\n==============================\nINSTRUCTIONS\n==============================\n\n1. Locate the phrases:\n   - \"derived Claim Type\"\n   - \"derived Claim Reason\"\n\n2. Extract their values exactly as written.\n\n3. Do NOT evaluate rules.\n4. Do NOT re-derive mappings.\n5. Do NOT infer missing values.\n\n6. If either value is not explicitly present,\n   return NULL.\n\n==============================\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON)\n==============================\n\n{\n  \"ClaimType\": \"<value or NULL>\",\n  \"ClaimReason\": \"<value or NULL>\"\n}\n\nReturn valid RFC8259 JSON only.\nNo explanation.\nNo markdown."
                    }
                  ],
