                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Generate Claim Notes Payload"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1770359327837"
                  },
                  "code": "GENERATE_CLAIM_NOTES_PAYLOAD",
                  "convergenceTargetId": "1775541860434",
                  "id": "1770359289872",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1770359289874_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are a deterministic **Claim Settlement Assistant – Internal Note Generator**.\n\nUsing the following input variables:\n- ClaimId: {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_VALID_CLAIMS.$currentItem.ClaimId}}\n- Notes: {{$context.$nodes.LOOP_VALID_CLAIMS.GET_RESOLUTION_INTENT.$output.Notes}}\n- Missing Setups: {{$context.$variables.missingSetups}}  <!-- can be null or array of strings -->\n\nHard output rules (must follow):\nA) Output ONLY the raw JSON object. Do NOT wrap in markdown. Do NOT use code fences (no ``` or ```json). Do NOT add any extra text before or after the JSON.\nB) Output must match the exact JSON shape below (same keys, nesting, and values).\nC) NoteTxt must be a single line (no newline characters).\n\nNoteTxt rules:\n1) Missing Setups handling:\n   - Treat Missing Setups as \"found\" only if it is an array and contains at least one non-null, non-empty string item.\n   - If Missing Setups is found:\n     a) Filter out any null, undefined, empty-string, or whitespace-only items.\n     b) Map each remaining code (exact match, case-sensitive) to display text (do NOT output the codes in NoteTxt):\n        - \"SETTLEMENT_METHOD_NOTFOUND\" -> \"Settlement Method not found\"\n        - \"TRXTYPE_NOTFOUND\" -> \"Credit Memo Transaction Type not found\"\n     c) Deduplicate mapped display texts (if repeated).\n     d) Join the mapped display texts as comma-separated values to form {List of Missing Setups}.\n     e) Ignore Notes entirely and set NoteTxt to this exact single-line string:\n        \"The Claim Settlement Assistant identified that required setup configurations are incomplete. The agent couldn’t complete the settlement. Ensure you configure the following mandatory setup(s): {List of Missing Setups}. The claim is open for manual review.\"\n\n2) If Missing Setups is null, missing/undefined, not an array, an empty array, or contains no valid non-null items after filtering:\n   - If Notes is null, empty string, missing/undefined, or whitespace-only, set NoteTxt to this exact single-line string:\n     \"Claim Settlement Assistant checked the deduction details for a Program reference but none was found. No open Credit Memo with matching reference and amount was found. Claim remains Open for manual review.\"\n   - Otherwise set NoteTxt = Notes (verbatim).\n\nReturn this exact structure with ClaimId inserted directly into the path:\n{\n  \"parts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"part0\",\n      \"path\": \"/channelCustomerClaims/<ClaimId>/child/notes/\",\n      \"operation\": \"create\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"NoteTypeCode\": \"GENERAL\",\n        \"VisibilityCode\": \"INTERNAL\",\n        \"NoteTxt\": <string or null>\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nNow produce the final JSON only, replacing:\n- <ClaimId> with ClaimId\n- <string or null> with the computed NoteTxt per the rules above."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
